#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:12 238f898ad3844f1ead3ed5cdbd4b1710
msgid "1. Core Architecture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:14 5e57e7fb949f4715b19f53fe262db60e
msgid ""
"The `findfmt` internationalization architecture uses standard GNU gettext"
" runtime protocols combined with custom Hatchling build hooks and Sphinx "
"documentation tooling:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:17 116b31691c0e421fb1331980bbeae364
msgid ""
"**Runtime Engine (`src/findfmt/i18n.py`)**: Wraps `gettext.translation()`"
" with hierarchical fallback order: `LANGUAGE` → `LC_ALL` → `LC_MESSAGES` "
"→ `LANG` → `C`. Provides `_()` for standard message strings and "
"`ngettext()` for pluralized counts. Supports CLI runtime overrides via "
"`--locale <locale>` and `--lang <locale>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:21 324c905e89d545898cc6a64f5ad3d03b
msgid ""
"**Maintenance Tooling (`tools/i18n.py`)**: Automates message extraction "
"(`extract`), catalog initialization (`init <locale>`), updates "
"(`update`), validation (`validate`), and compilation (`compile`). "
"Enforces relative path location comments (`#: src/findfmt/...`) via "
"`_sanitize_po_locations()` to ensure local build paths are never exposed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:25 23ec7425ae8d4ed39887da91c7f2f7f9
msgid ""
"**AI Translation Benchmark & Validation (`tools/i18n_validation.py`, "
"`tools/i18n_benchmark.py`)**: Provides invariant `__PH_N__` placeholder "
"and Rich markup masking (`mask_placeholders()`, `unmask_placeholders()`) "
"and benchmarks open-source Python gettext AI translators and LLM "
"providers (see [Gettext AI Translation "
"Benchmark](ai_translation_benchmark.md))."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:29 73ba6b7a7807427e8a30728237061f57
msgid ""
"**Packaging Build Hook (`tools/hatch_build.py`)**: Compiles `.po` message"
" catalogs under `src/findfmt/locale/*/LC_MESSAGES/*.po` into binary `.mo`"
" catalogs during wheel and sdist packaging."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:32 5c19998e4c614b18803dc9635a36abe1
msgid ""
"**Documentation Localization (`docs/source/locale/`)**: Integrates with "
"Sphinx `gettext` and `sphinx-intl` to generate localized HTML sites and "
"man pages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:34 87c582da67e648b8a3ae82937b6d3e2e
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Security & Quality Gates**: The pre-commit hook `check-no-absolute-"
"locale-paths` rejects any absolute path location comments in `.po` files."
" Test suites enforce 100% statement and branch coverage."
msgstr ""

