#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:57 d9eb256f01a745849149221b440ebc54
msgid ""
"To support global scripts, bidirectional rendering, and regional "
"standards, five foundational infrastructure issues have been established:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:60 0dbccb7693d04413a0cdbdac7b56421f
msgid ""
"**[#229: feat(i18n): implement right-to-left (RTL) and bidirectional "
"(BiDi) terminal formatting "
"support](https://github.com/bdperkin/findfmt/issues/229)** Enables visual"
" bidirectional reordering (Unicode BiDi algorithm) for monospace table "
"(`RichTableFormatter`) and tree (`RichTreeFormatter`) formatters when "
"outputting Arabic (`ar`), Urdu (`ur`), Persian (`fa`), Hebrew (`he`), or "
"Kurdish (`ku`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:64 33aedbb9d62d4a61ac77f2ab7c428f5e
msgid ""
"**[#230: fix(format): audit and enforce cell-width alignment for CJK "
"double-width characters across "
"formatters](https://github.com/bdperkin/findfmt/issues/230)** Audits "
"terminal column calculation to ensure full-width East Asian glyphs "
"(Chinese `zh_CN`/`zh_TW`, Japanese `ja`, Korean `ko`) occupy two terminal"
" cells using `wcwidth`/`cell_len` instead of string length."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:68 5b58a4c829d4492995c0e5c87cac53e1
msgid ""
"**[#231: feat(i18n): localize file sizes, numeric separators, and "
"timestamps per regional locale "
"standards](https://github.com/bdperkin/findfmt/issues/231)** Adapts "
"decimal separators (`12.4 MB` vs `12,4 MB`), thousands separators, and "
"date-time formats according to active `LC_NUMERIC` and `LC_TIME` "
"settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:71 7bdce509eb674815829515c126f2585e
msgid ""
"**[#232: test(i18n): create automated verification suite for complex "
"multi-tier gettext pluralization "
"rules](https://github.com/bdperkin/findfmt/issues/232)** Provides "
"automated test fixtures verifying plural mapping for single-form, two-"
"form, three-form Slavic, three-form Polish, and six-form Arabic rules in "
"`findfmt.i18n.ngettext`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:74 f2de409861e04e619cd23badfc303805
msgid ""
"**[#233: ci(docs): configure automated multilingual Sphinx documentation "
"builds in CI pipeline](https://github.com/bdperkin/findfmt/issues/233)** "
"Configures `.github/workflows/docs.yml` to compile and publish "
"multilingual Sphinx documentation subdirectories (`docs/<locale>/`)."
msgstr ""

